<title>USA: Westmoreland County, Pa., approves $10 mln bonds.</title>
<headline>Westmoreland County, Pa., approves $10 mln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMORELAND COUNTY, Pa. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westmoreland County, Pa., commissioners approved more than $10 million of bonds in a debt restructuring program.</p>
<p>The money will be used to refinance existing debt and toward capital improvement projects.</p>
<p>Council members said it also means they can avoid raising taxes until at least 2000.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
